            <note corresp="#d39-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d39-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Ford Library, National Security Adviser, Memoranda of Conversations,
                    1973–1977, Box 6. Secret; Nodis. The meeting was held in the Oval Office.
                    According to the President’s Daily Diary, Ford met with Kissinger there from
                    10:35 to 11:50 a.m.; Scowcroft joined the meeting at 10:40. (Ibid., White House
                    Office Files)</p>
